Added analysis unification primitives across ``dim_reduction``, ``io``, ``utils``, and ``decoding``: optional skipping of geometric fit metrics in dim-reduction sweeps and reports, ``DataContainer.subsample``, cached ``get_environment_info()``, predefined CV folds, per-block PCA/scaling preprocessing, ``ExperimentConfig.return_estimator`` with ``ExperimentResult.predict``, ``ABMILClassifier`` (backed by optional ``torchmil`` extra) with group routing and attention artifacts, and rank-averaged ensembling / nested OOF stacking helpers. Behaviour changes: a feature block no wider than its PCA size enters unreduced; ``stratified`` CV lowers ``n_splits`` to the smallest class's count when ``auto_reduce_n_splits`` is on (the default); ``return_estimator=True`` also keeps ``decision_function`` scores (``y_score``) in the predictions; a stacking input that fails to fit raises an error naming it.
